+#### Example response
+
+```http
+HTTP/1.1 200 OK
+Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8
+
+{
+    "message": "Role removed from user."
+}
+```
+
+#### Status codes
+
+| Code | Description                                                          |
+| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| 200  | Role is unassigned.                                                  |
+| 403  | Access denied.                                                       |
