+export http_proxy=http://proxy.domain:3128/
+export https_proxy=http://proxy.domain:3128/
+```
+
+##### Centos 7
+
+If you are on Centos 7, add the following lines to the `/etc/sysconfig/grafana-server` file.
+
+```
