+# Release notes for Grafana 8.0.0-beta2
+
+### Features and enhancements
+
+- **AppPlugins:** Expose react-router to apps. [#33775](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/33775), [@dprokop](https://github.com/dprokop)
