+
+### v8.2.6
+
+- **Security:** Upgrade Alpine based images to [3.14.3](https://alpinelinux.org/posts/Alpine-3.14.3-released.html). [#42061](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/42061), [@dsotirakis](https://github.com/dsotirakis)
